<title>SOUTH AFRICA:  CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DECLARE AT 628-8 VS S.AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DECLARE AT 628-8 VS S.AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia declared their first innings closed at 628 for eight on the fourth day of the first test against South Africa at the Wanderers on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 302, Australia 628-8 (Greg Blewett 214, Steve Waugh 160, Matthew Elliott 85).</p>
